    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a39">

                <pb facs="0571" n="521" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg521"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 39.—From the legation of Portugal at
                        Buenos Ayres.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-16"><hi rendition="#small-caps">April</hi> 16,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Government of Uruguay asks authorization to disembark fugitive Antonio Santos
                    Abren, severely ill with beri-beri, on board corvette <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Alfonso de Albuquerque</hi>, making itself responsible to restore him to
                    the Portuguese Government alive or dead. I beg <pb facs="0572" n="522"
                        xml:id="pg522"/> the speedy decision of your excellency. Transport leaves
                    to-night, intending to leave Ponta India with refugees to-morrow night.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Faria.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
